    intro: 'Emi interviews graduates Kenta and Sora about entering work. Family support and private schooling gave Kenta resources that Sora lacked while working through university. Sora had less time for internships and other activities. Effort mattered, but did not erase every disadvantage. Later, Daisuke recalls his uncle helping him find an affordable café location. His own story also combines work with support.',
